{"id":"vod_md_2650","vodId":"2650","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"偶像大师 XENOGLOSSIA","name_cn":"偶像大师 XENOGLOSSIA","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"26集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230817-1/37438a082923bd10408943685dc9d43d.jpg"},"summary":"未来，月球突然爆炸变成碎片，地球各大都市遭到陨石碎片袭击，放眼望去一片废墟。与拥有核武的国家不同，日本为了应对天灾开发了代号为IDOL的机器人负责清理碎片。家住寒冷山区的少女天海春香（井口裕香 配音）参加了偶像大师（IDOL MASTER）的遴选，并顺利取得录取通知书。在此之后，她告别家人，独自上京，并在新干线上结识了同样前往十六夜宿舍的萩原雪步（堀江由衣 配音）。谁知刚到东京不久她们便卷入巨大的混乱中。在此之后，春香与雪步在水濑伊织、菊地真等前辈的指导下学习IDOL课程，逐渐成长起来，她也终于投身到驾驶IDOL处理碎片的任务中。然而，另有一个神秘组织意图抢夺IDOL，绞碎了友情的战争不可避免爆发……本片为根据同名游戏制作的衍生科幻动画。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-17 07:40:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/oLsgOecM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/IPMNCIxR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/1TjUwSKA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/lWboJkQY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/EAWSpZxT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/ZIRr5bVb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/IewQ1dfy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/kPTb7bMb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/VfTCelUO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/7k0EQu9b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/TjwWwwaJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/iINssMk4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/IJDyKtsi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230815/RO7KmBwa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https:/